<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Roomavie" description="Learn how Roomavie handles information when you browse, contact us, or sign up for our newsletter."><section class="legal-page content-width"><span class="eyebrow">The little details</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="legal-lead">We want your time here to feel comfortable, including how your information is handled.</p><h2>Browsing Roomavie</h2><p>This site does not use advertising cookies or analytics scripts. Search and article filters run in your browser. Our hosting provider may process standard request information, such as your IP address, to deliver the site.</p><h2>Getting in touch</h2><p>If you email us, your email provider and ours process your message. We use the information you share to respond to your inquiry.</p><h2>Our newsletter</h2><p>When newsletter registration is available, the signup form sends your email address to our newsletter service to handle your subscription. Until registration is connected, the form does not send or store your email. You can unsubscribe using the link in any newsletter.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Some links lead to other websites, including social platforms. Those sites have their own privacy policies. Following an external link is your choice.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>If you have a question about your information, please <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p></section></Layout>
